Error [E2910]: `reactive.derived` needs a lambda, not Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/reactive_derived_not_lambda.jet:3:27
    |
  3 |     d := reactive.derived(42)
    |                           ^^
 Why: a reactive derived is built from a `() => …` body so it can re-run when a signal changes
 Fix: write `reactive.derived(() => { … })`

Error [E0311]: `get` isn't a method on this value
  --> tests/ui/reactive_derived_not_lambda.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     print(d.get())
    |             ^^^
 Why: only struct and enum values have instance methods
 Fix: check the spelling of `get`
